{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","裂风穿刺"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","風を裂く棘"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","击退1名敌人并为其添加“丛林印记”。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","敵1体を後退させ、さらに「森の印」を付与"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，卡夫拉会优先攻击处于“丛林印记”状态的敌人，“丛林印记”最多只会存在1个。使用终极技能时，卡夫拉为一名敌人添加“丛林印记”，对其造成迅猛绝伦的一击，造成500% + 50% ATK伤害，并击退2格。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","パッシブ効果：「森の印」が付与されている敵を優先的に攻撃。「森の印」は1つまでしか存在できない。必殺技発動時、敵1体に「森の印」を付与し、相手を素早く攻撃して500% + 50% ATKのダメージを与え、2マス後退させる"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":84,"end":90,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":83,"end":89,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":80,"end":94,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":79,"end":93,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至510% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが510% + 50% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至520% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが520% + 50% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRat